Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HayBaleFallingInFog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasEvidence :indicator1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .
:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Hay bale falling/floating in road" .
:indicator1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Hay bale intrusion into vehicle lane causing potential collision" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Lane intrusion due to a falling object (hay bale) in low visibility conditions.
Severity Score: 0.75